# The protopack's hum across a save, SaveAnywhere: ON (fixtures/protoload:
# fixtures/proto's lba.cfg with the key, and its save). The protopack put
# on from the inventory, Twinsen flies and is saved in flight on New
# Game's line as zed. L loads zed, the hum playing again, Up keeps him in
# flight, whose end alone would stop it, and F1 takes the protopack off,
# which stops it.

hold 0.15
sleep 40
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
sleep 15
key Shift_L
sleep 2
key Right
sleep 1
key Right
sleep 1
key Right
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 4
down Up
sleep 3
shot flying
hold 0.05
key s
up Up
sleep 2
key End
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 1
key z e d
sleep 0.5
key Return
sleep 3
shot saved
key l
sleep 2
shot list
key Return
hold 0.15
down Up
sleep 12
shot loaded
key F1
up Up
sleep 6
shot off
